--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   tb277 eth4   10.38.22.65/27   and   10.38.22.66/27
                (the two client addresses the rules discriminate between; the
                 test client BINDS to one of them before connecting)
        |
        v   TCP SYN -> 10.38.22.67:22  (SSH), VLAN 100
   port1.0.48   (VLAN 100 access)
