  |                                         Falcon           |
  |   vlan100  10.38.22.67/27      <- the vty endpoint       |
  |   line vty 0 7                                           |
  |     vty access-class 1 | 2 | 3 | 4   <== THE BINDING     |
  |   SSH listener on tcp/22                                 |
  +==========================================================+
        X  no far side: the connection TERMINATES on the DUT's own vty.
           The result measured is ACCEPTED (SSH banner), TIMEOUT or REFUSED
