  DUT     : swi_c (AT-x960-56YSQ) console u2 @115200, S/N A2WQS7004,
            Marvell 98CX8514 Falcon, netboots; given 10.38.22.67/27 on vlan100 for this case
            so the vty lines are reachable
  link    : swi_c port1.0.48 <-> tb277 eth4 (VLAN 100 access)
  host    : tb277 eth4, 10.38.22.65/27 and 10.38.22.66/27 -> swi_c port1.0.48
  unused  : swi_b (console u3) and swi_a (console u5) carried no traffic in this case;
